WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.876 --> 00:00:02.044
Life likes to test you.

00:00:02.628 --> 00:00:04.171
And when you
make a bad choice,

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:07.424
living with what you've done
can be its own punishment.

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:08.884
Oh, my gorgonzola...

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:19.937
I recently got out
of federal prison,

00:00:20.521 --> 00:00:22.397
and I'm trying
to get back on my feet.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.316
Now, this is my life.

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:28.946
Take a moment&nbsp;
to examine the bow.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:31.323
You're allowed
to hold a weapon, right?

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:35.744
Well, well.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.748
That's my good girl.

00:00:45.337 --> 00:00:46.797
Don't focus on what you can't.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.173
Focus on what you can.

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:50.008
What is it you really want?

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:51.510
Ice cream.

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:54.346
And justice.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.867
I've never heard
you laugh before.

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:18.870
It is unnerving.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.957
What do we do
when we reach

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.042
the place where&nbsp;
we don't know what to do?

00:01:24.126 --> 00:01:27.004
-Gonna get through this.
-So it will be like old times?

00:01:28.297 --> 00:01:31.133
-Giving up is not the answer.
-It is good to see you.

00:01:35.554 --> 00:01:38.098
We have to find
our own answers.

00:01:38.974 --> 00:01:40.434
You shouldn't be afraid.

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:42.269
It's the first step
in moving on.

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:45.147
Read it in a pamphlet.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.694
Maybe this is
the beginning of a road back.

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:53.864
There's gotta be a way back.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:54.865
Okay, all right.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:01:59.745
Wait.

00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:03.206
This is a special chicken.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:04.833
This is a magical chicken.

00:02:06.501 --> 00:02:07.502
No spoilers.

